                            A small toy OCR
                               by Mibi88

A small toy OCR I started coding a while ago. It is broken and does not work.
However, parts of it work (more or less), and may be interesting, for instance
text rendering of TrueType fonts.

Different parts of it can be enabled by the defines in src/main.c. You may want
to select the thing you want.

It only depends on the libc, it is very portable ANSI C.
